WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.669
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:04.504
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.505
And now if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:09.809
The House January 6th committee
voted unanimously today

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.644
to subpoena
former President Trump.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.880
I would say this is big news,

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.682
but it's really more like
putting one more parking ticket

00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:19.685
on that van that's been
on your block for a year.

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:21.955
That ticket ain't getting paid.

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.323
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:25.324
According to a new report,
when former President Trump

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:27.326
received a subpoena
earlier this year

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:29.995
for any classified documents
taken from the White House,

00:00:29.995 --> 00:00:33.599
he told an employee to move
boxes to his personal residence.

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:36.102
Man, he is a bad criminal.

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:38.337
You're supposed to get rid
of the evidence.

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:42.509
Trump is the first criminal to
plant the evidence on himself.

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:43.510
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:44.543
"This weed?

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:46.346
No, I'm not holding this
for a friend."

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:48.514
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:51.684
"I bought this with my money!"

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.653
A jury in Connecticut yesterday

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:57.991
ordered conspiracy theorist Alex
Jones to pay nearly $1 billion

00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:00.293
to the families affected by
the Sandy Hook shooting.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.995
So, I hope he got paid
really well for his work

00:01:02.995 --> 00:01:04.831
as the Mucinex guy.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.966
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.704
The FDA announced yesterday
that it has authorized

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.540
the omicron targeted coronavirus
vaccine booster shots

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:17.209
for children as young
as five years old.

00:01:17.209 --> 00:01:20.413
Which is great news if you're
a parent of young children

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:22.581
or think that you might be.

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:24.584
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:29.088
Producers for Lebron James'
talk show "The Shop"

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:32.258
announced yesterday that they
will not air an upcoming episode

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:34.927
with Kanye West due to his use
of hate speech.

00:01:34.927 --> 00:01:36.596
Because once they
edited it all out,

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.098
this is what
they were left with.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:40.633
-So...

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:42.502
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:44.670
And...

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:46.472
-That wasn't that bad.

00:01:46.472 --> 00:01:47.807
That wasn't that offensive.

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.141
[ Applause ]

00:01:49.141 --> 00:01:50.477
A few edits, and that was just

00:01:50.477 --> 00:01:52.145
I think
what all of us are thinking.

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:53.579
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:56.281
A man in Idaho recently broke
a Guinness World Record

00:01:56.281 --> 00:01:59.285
for longest duration balancing
a guitar on his chin.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:03.122
Even more amazing, he managed to
keep it on there the entire time

00:02:03.122 --> 00:02:05.291
he was being kicked out
of the party.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.826
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:10.964
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:14.100
Meta...

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.868
Meta this week launched

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:18.704
its most advanced
virtual reality headset ever,

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:20.372
which costs $1,500.

00:02:20.372 --> 00:02:22.374
They're so advanced,
you'll completely forget

00:02:22.374 --> 00:02:24.110
that your wife left you.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.278
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.278 --> 00:02:31.116
The car company Rezvani has
announced a new $250,000 SUV

00:02:31.116 --> 00:02:33.953
called the Vengeance, which has
options for body armor,

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:36.122
explosive protection,
and night vision.

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.623
So come hell or high water,

00:02:37.623 --> 00:02:40.960
your kids will get to soccer!

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.129
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:45.464
Today was National No Bra Day.

00:02:45.464 --> 00:02:47.734
So, looks like
Biden hasn't undone

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:50.069
ALL of Trump's executive orders.

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:52.438
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:56.976
Dunkin' Donuts recently changed
its customer loyalty program

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:59.645
from DD Perks
to Dunkin' Rewards,

00:02:59.645 --> 00:03:02.181
and I can only assume
it's because they were sued

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:04.517
by a 1980s porn star.

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:08.187
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.187 --> 00:03:10.356
"Happy No Bra Day, Dee Dee!"

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:12.058
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:18.531
And finally, the Social Security
Administration announced today

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:21.367
that recipients will receive
a cost of living adjustment

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:23.536
next year of 8.7%.

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:25.638
So, get ready for that
to trickle down

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:27.640
to your $5 birthday checks!

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.641
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:30.577
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

